zola (0.23.3-3) unstable; urgency=high

  * Install zola without the setuid bit; the binary was shipped mode
    04755 (setuid root)
  * Install the zsh completion under usr/share/zsh/vendor-completions,
    where zsh actually looks
  * Synopsis without the leading article; override embedded-library
    (Rust links vendored C dependencies statically by design)

 -- pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>  Sat, 15 Aug 2026 18:31:54 +0200

